---
interface Props {kind:'web'|'branding'|'marketing'|'design';}
const {kind}=Astro.props;
const projects={
 anvil:{name:'Anvil & Forge',location:'Springfield, Illinois',href:'/anvil-and-forge',text:'Brand identity, beer packaging, photography, and a website that share the brewery’s character.'},
 church:{name:'Koke Mill Church',location:'Springfield, Illinois',href:'/koke-mill-church',text:'A custom Squarespace website with clear paths for newcomers, members, and community information.'},
 villas:{name:'The Villas',location:'Sherman, Illinois',href:'/the-villas',text:'Website design, social creative, and photography connected by a consistent visual identity.'}
};
const selected=kind==='web'?[projects.anvil,projects.church,projects.villas]:[projects.anvil,projects.villas];
const faqs=kind==='web'?[
 ['Can you redesign an existing business website?','Yes. We can work from your existing website and content, review what needs to stay, and plan improvements to the structure, visuals, and next steps. If page URLs change, redirects should be part of the launch plan.'],
 ['Can you help customers find a Springfield business online?','We build relevant service information, clear page titles, descriptive image text, and internal links into the website. Your business details and Google Business Profile should agree. Search visibility also depends on competition, location, content, and reputation; a new website does not guarantee a particular ranking.'],
 ['What should I prepare for a website project?','Start with your services, the customers you want to reach, existing brand files, and any text or photographs you already have. We’ll review your current site and agree on the page list, content responsibilities, and review process before beginning.']
]:kind==='branding'?[
 ['Can you keep parts of my existing identity?','Yes. We can discuss what customers already recognize, what feels dated, and which elements need to work more consistently. That helps establish whether the project calls for a refinement or a new creative direction.'],
 ['Can the branding carry through to my website and print materials?','Yes. We can plan those applications together. The logo packages include different levels of identity assets and launch materials; website design, printing, and additional collateral are scoped separately.'],
 ['What helps you understand my business?','Your audience, services, existing materials, and examples of how the identity will be used are useful starting points. Feedback on one selected direction helps shape a coherent final identity.']
]:[
 ['Can you work with our existing brand?','Yes. Share your brand guidelines, available assets, and the materials you need. We can build on your current identity and identify where a more consistent approach would help.'],
 ['How do you decide what to create first?','We start with your audience, the message, and the practical use of the work. That gives each deliverable a purpose, whether it is a printed piece, social creative, advertising, or a website update.']
];
---
<section class="local-context container" aria-labelledby="local-work-heading">
 <div class="local-heading"><h2 id="local-work-heading">Creative work with<br/>local roots.</h2><p>Zion Creative is based in Springfield, Illinois. Explore examples of our work for businesses and organizations in Springfield and nearby Sherman.</p></div>
 <div class="local-projects" style={`--local-columns:${selected.length}`}>{selected.map(project=><article><p class="local-place">{project.location}</p><h3><a href={project.href}>{project.name}</a></h3><p>{project.text}</p><a class="local-link" href={project.href}>Explore the {project.name} project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>)}</div>
 <div class="local-questions"><h2>{kind==='web'?'Planning your website':kind==='branding'?'Planning your brand':'Planning your next project'}</h2><div>{faqs.map(([question,answer])=><details><summary>{question}</summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}<p class="local-next">{kind==='web'||kind==='branding'?<a href={`/pricing#${kind==='web'?'websites':'branding'}`}>Compare {kind==='web'?'website':'branding'} packages</a>:<a href="/contact">Discuss your project</a>}</p><p class="local-next"><a href="/service-areas">Explore our service areas across Illinois and beyond</a></p></div></div>
</section>
<style>
.local-context{padding-block:65px 80px}.local-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:55px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:32px}.local-heading h2{font-size:clamp(32px,3.6vw,50px)}.local-heading>p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#55534d}.local-projects{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(var(--local-columns),minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px}.local-projects article{padding:28px;border:1px solid #b9b6ab;border-radius:12px;background:#f8f7f3;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.local-place{font-size:13px;color:#59574f;margin-bottom:14px}.local-projects h3{font-size:27px;margin-bottom:18px}.local-projects p:not(.local-place){font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#55534d;margin-bottom:24px}.local-link{font-size:14px;margin-top:auto;line-height:1.6}.local-context a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.local-questions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.5fr;gap:60px;margin-top:65px}.local-questions h2{font-size:32px;line-height:1.2}.local-questions details{border-top:1px solid #b9b6ab;padding:20px 0}.local-questions summary{font-size:18px;font-weight:550;cursor:pointer}.local-questions details p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin-top:18px;color:#55534d}.local-next{font-size:16px;margin-top:24px}@media(max-width:760px){.local-context{padding-block:40px 50px}.local-heading,.local-questions{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.local-projects{grid-template-columns:1fr}.local-questions{margin-top:40px}.local-projects article{padding:24px}}
</style>
